Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.30,1:10:41.74,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}雲の下に見える
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.90,1:10:46.09,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们穿过熟悉的街道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.90,1:10:46.09,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}僕らの街こえて
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.00,1:10:50.74,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你我共同所歌唱的旋律
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.00,1:10:50.74,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と僕で　歌うメロディー
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.90,1:10:54.83,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一起奏唱吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.90,1:10:54.83,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}奏でよう！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.81,1:11:05.66,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}总算是走到了  比想象要远的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.81,1:11:05.66,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}随分遠くまで来てしまったね
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.01,1:11:19.95,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}然而我们  {\t(4000,4200,\3c&HE199FD&)}如过去那样笑容依旧  {\t(6600,6800,\3c&H726607&)}没有一丝的变化与伙伴们一起
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.01,1:11:19.95,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}でも僕たちは　{\t(4000,4200,\3c&HE199FD&)}昔みたいに笑って　{\t(6600,6800,\3c&H726607&)}何にも変わらない仲間と一緒に
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.95,1:11:24.33,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}自由自在地飞向  闪闪发光的星星身旁
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.95,1:11:24.33,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}キラキラと光る　星まで飛んで行こう
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.33,1:11:28.81,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在圆梦的地方  一起拍拍手
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.33,1:11:28.81,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夢叶う場所で　手を叩こう
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.81,1:11:33.36,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}即使是漫无目的地  在某地了迷失方向
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.81,1:11:33.36,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ふらふらどこかで　はぐれてしまっても
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.36,1:11:37.85,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我便悄悄地将你的  手牵在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.36,1:11:37.85,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}そっと僕は君の　手をつなごう
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.02,1:11:49.86,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这是无尽的旅途  {\t(2400,2600,\3c&H3999F3&)}一直地一直地{\t(3200,3400,\3c&HE199FD&)}永远永远{\3c&H726607&}一步接一步  一同向前进吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.02,1:11:49.86,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}終わりない旅さ　{\t(2400,2600,\3c&H3999F3&)}いつもいつも{\t(3200,3400,\3c&HE199FD&)}ずっとずっと{\3c&H726607&}一歩ずつ　前に進もう
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.63,1:11:59.13,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}没有捷径可走  永无止尽的旅程
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.63,1:11:59.13,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近道はないさ　終わりない旅さ
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.62,1:12:08.21,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}没有捷径可走  永无止尽的旅程
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.62,1:12:08.21,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近道はないさ　終わりない旅さ
Comment: 0,1:12:23.20,1:12:28.65,Title,,0,0,0,,#14 99 Nights
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.65,1:12:28.65,词曲,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\an4}#14 99 Nights{\fs35}\N\N作词：MC TC\N作曲：Taku Inoue\N编曲：Taku Inoue\N翻译：YOU宅
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.18,1:12:48.35,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.18,1:12:48.35,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.35,1:12:51.52,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不断重复上演着  相遇与再见
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.35,1:12:51.52,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ハロー&グッバイ　繰り返してた
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.46,1:12:56.82,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}相互倾述着  暧昧不足的话语
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.46,1:12:56.82,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}曖昧な足りない言葉　やりとりしては
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.76,1:13:02.15,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}亦或哭泣  亦或欢笑或是悲喜交错
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.76,1:13:02.15,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}泣いたり　笑ったり　すれ違ったり
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.63,1:13:07.40,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}清晨将至  装做视而不见
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.63,1:13:07.40,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近づく朝　見ないふりして
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.34,1:13:13.21,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}若是今晚定能道出心意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.34,1:13:13.21,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}今夜ならばきっと言える
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.66,1:13:18.22,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为看到了流星
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.66,1:13:18.22,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流れ星を見たから
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.95,1:13:23.87,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}1在第一百天的早晨
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.95,1:13:23.87,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}100番目の朝が君を
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.29,1:13:28.54,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你被虏获到远方之前
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.29,1:13:28.54,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どこか遠くへさらう前に
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.74,1:13:31.07,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.74,1:13:31.07,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.07,1:13:34.85,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}想与你述说  你可曾感到过幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.07,1:13:34.85,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}話したいな　幸せだったかな
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.16,1:13:39.67,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}想要见你之类的话哪怕一次也未曾说过出口
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.16,1:13:39.67,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}会いたいなんて一度だって言えなかった
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.42,1:13:43.06,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}为何闪闪星光如飘浮的高光
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.42,1:13:43.06,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}なんてスターライト　浮かぶハイライト
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.06,1:13:45.34,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}寂静的夜幕降临
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.06,1:13:45.34,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}静かな夜が来た
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.34,1:13:50.22,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}而你却仍未到来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.34,1:13:50.22,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君はまだ来ないね
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.85,1:14:03.00,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Daring Daring
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.85,1:14:03.00,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ダーリンダーリン
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.00,1:14:06.26,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}向星空为你日夜祈福
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.00,1:14:06.26,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星空に願い続けた
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.25,1:14:11.81,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}为何总觉得明天的聚会将不会存在
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.25,1:14:11.81,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}明日にならないパーティー　ある気がしてた
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.83,1:14:18.20,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}心怀抱着不确定的期待
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.83,1:14:18.20,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}何かに不確かな期待を抱いて
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.68,1:14:23.69,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}对到来清晨假装视而不见
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.68,1:14:23.69,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近づく朝見ないふりした
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.23,1:14:29.24,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我明白的  {\t(2700,2900,\3c&H3999F3&)}也是一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.23,1:14:29.24,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}わかってたんだ　{\t(2700,2900,\3c&H3999F3&)}知ってたんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.56,1:14:34.41,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}纵使看到了流星
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.56,1:14:34.41,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流れ星を見たって
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.03,1:14:38.42,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在第一百天的早晨
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.03,1:14:38.42,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}100番目の朝は
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.42,1:14:45.39,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与你共同欢笑  {\t(4600,4800,\3c&H3999F3&)}彼此分享
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.42,1:14:45.39,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と笑いあったり　{\t(4600,4800,\3c&H3999F3&)}分かちあったり
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.70,1:14:50.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一起手牵着手  {\t(2500,2700,\3c&H726607&)}已化为泡影
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.70,1:14:50.01,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}手をつないだり{\t(2500,2700,\3c&H726607&)}できないこと
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.21,1:14:52.43,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.21,1:14:52.43,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.43,1:14:56.11,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你我两人  还没彼此深入了解
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.43,1:14:56.11,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}二人　まだ知らないことばかり
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.52,1:14:58.97,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在相遇之前  喜欢的颜色
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.52,1:14:58.97,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}出会う前も　好きな色も
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.97,1:15:01.20,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}和喜欢的人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.97,1:15:01.20,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好きな人も
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.86,1:15:04.38,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如今不合时宜的灯光已经
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.86,1:15:04.38,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}場違いなライトアップが今
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.52,1:15:06.71,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}融为街道的路灯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.52,1:15:06.71,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溶けてく街灯り
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.71,1:15:11.55,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如同流星一般
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.71,1:15:11.55,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流れ星みたいね
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.23,1:15:35.09,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}呐  想和你述说
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.23,1:15:35.09,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ねえ話したいな
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.09,1:15:36.53,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这99Nights
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.09,1:15:36.53,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.53,1:15:38.83,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你可曾感到过幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.53,1:15:38.83,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}幸せだったかな
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.16,1:15:43.08,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}清晨到临
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.16,1:15:43.08,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}朝がくる
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.81,1:15:49.33,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}对啊其实我想每时每刻都温柔地对待你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.81,1:15:49.33,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}そう本当はいつだって優しくしたかった
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.47,1:15:57.16,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}离别也只会在梦中呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.47,1:15:57.16,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}さよならは夢の中ね
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.88,1:15:59.08,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.88,1:15:59.08,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.08,1:16:00.44,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我不会伤心的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.08,1:16:00.44,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}泣いてないわ
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.44,1:16:02.83,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为时间已到  清晨来临
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.44,1:16:02.83,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}もうタイムアップ　朝だから
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.04,1:16:05.69,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}呐  听我说  那个…那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.04,1:16:05.69,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ねえ聞いて　あのね　あのね
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.69,1:16:07.73,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我喜欢你哟
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.69,1:16:07.73,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君が好きよ
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.50,1:16:09.68,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}想传达给你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.50,1:16:09.68,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}伝えたいな
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.68,1:16:11.21,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}希望朝阳不要到来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.68,1:16:11.21,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来ないでサンライズ
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.21,1:16:13.36,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如今你已不再出现
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.21,1:16:13.36,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}今はもう君がいない
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.58,1:16:18.18,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}愿在梦中相会
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.58,1:16:18.18,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夢の中会いたい
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.86,1:16:23.54,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}愿在梦中相会
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.86,1:16:23.54,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夢の中会いたい
Comment: 0,1:16:34.45,1:16:39.45,Title,,0,0,0,,#15 VOY@GER
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.45,1:16:39.45,词曲,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\an4}#15 VOY@GER{\fs35}\N\N作词：乌屋茶房\N作曲：井上馨太\N编曲：井上馨太\N翻译：花椰菜牧师
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.91,1:17:20.45,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「在这片星空的另一端
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.91,1:17:20.45,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「この空の向こう側には
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.45,1:17:23.90,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}会有怎样的世界在等待？」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.45,1:17:23.90,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どんな世界が待ってるの？」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.90,1:17:27.42,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因胸口漫溢而出的心跳
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.90,1:17:27.42,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溢れ出した胸の鼓動で
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.42,1:17:29.89,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}有此无眠之夜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.42,1:17:29.89,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}眠れない夜に
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.04,1:17:33.28,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}向着地平线那端的远方
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.04,1:17:33.28,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}水平線の向こうの方へ
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.55,1:17:37.05,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}试着追逐流星探出的手
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.55,1:17:37.05,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流星を追って伸ばした手
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.05,1:17:40.70,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来吧  不妨就此动身奔赴前去
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.05,1:17:40.70,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}さぁ、立ち上がって走り出したら
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.70,1:17:44.05,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与我一同踏上旅途
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.70,1:17:44.05,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}旅に出よう、私と
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.05,1:17:45.90,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}直到遥远彼方
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.05,1:17:45.90,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}遠く遠くまで
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.06,1:17:53.41,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}去追寻那道辉光吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.06,1:17:53.41,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}輝きを追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.61,1:18:03.11,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我将催起好奇心的灯火
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.61,1:18:03.11,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好奇心のライト灯して
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.11,1:18:06.53,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}巡游在与你描绘的航路
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.11,1:18:06.53,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と描いた旅路をゆこう
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.53,1:18:10.02,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}跟着胸口漫溢出的心跳
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.53,1:18:10.02,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溢れ出した胸の鼓動の
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.02,1:18:12.71,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}乘上它的加速装置
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.02,1:18:12.71,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}加速装置に乗って
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.71,1:18:15.61,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星尘般浩渺的可能性中
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.71,1:18:15.61,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星屑みたいな可能性から
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.15,1:18:19.61,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}存在着联结星座的道标
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.15,1:18:19.61,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星座を繋いだ道標
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.61,1:18:23.00,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一扫内心的迷惘与不安
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.61,1:18:23.00,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}迷いも不安も今はないよ
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.27,1:18:26.56,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}回首身后的辉迹
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.27,1:18:26.56,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}振り返る輝跡
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.77,1:18:30.46,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那夜空的一闪  {\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}此刻想来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.77,1:18:30.46,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夜空の瞬き　{\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}今確かに
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.46,1:18:33.76,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}便是指尖飞掠过的闪光
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.46,1:18:33.76,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}指をかすめたきらめき
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.76,1:18:37.85,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}已经做好准备  {\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}你我一同
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.76,1:18:37.85,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}準備はできている　{\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}君も私も
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.85,1:18:40.59,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}奔赴向前吧  向着更遥远的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.85,1:18:40.59,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}飛び出そうよ　さらに
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.59,1:18:44.41,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}用“闪闪发光”什么的形容还远远不够
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.59,1:18:44.41,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}キラキラなんて言葉じゃまだ足りない
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.41,1:18:47.47,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我将变得比星星更耀眼
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.41,1:18:47.47,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星よりももっと眩しく
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.47,1:18:52.63,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}爱将成为开辟时代与未来的那道光
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.47,1:18:52.63,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}アイは時代を未来を拓く光になる
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.63,1:18:54.52,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}终有一天实现
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.63,1:18:54.52,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}なれるから
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.52,1:18:59.22,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请不要将你的视线移开
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.52,1:18:59.22,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}その目を離さないで
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.22,1:19:01.65,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与我一同前行吧  此刻
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.22,1:19:01.65,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}私と行こう、今
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.65,1:19:07.46,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}怀抱着这份无尽的愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.65,1:19:07.46,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}限りない願い抱いて
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.55,1:19:23.07,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}琥珀色的唱片正在唱响
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.55,1:19:23.07,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}飴色のレコード鳴らす
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.07,1:19:26.54,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}连星星也如共鸣般摇动
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.07,1:19:26.54,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}歌うように星が揺れる
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.54,1:19:30.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}合着胸口漫溢出的心跳
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.54,1:19:30.01,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溢れ出した胸の鼓動の
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.01,1:19:32.61,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}跟上它的节奏旋律
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.01,1:19:32.61,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}リズムに乗っかって
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.61,1:19:35.56,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}由木星的云带  拾级而上
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.61,1:19:35.56,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}木星の雲　ステップ踏んで
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.09,1:19:39.59,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}以土星的晕轮  作为舞台
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.09,1:19:39.59,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}土星の輪っか　ステージにして
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.59,1:19:43.34,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}追逐超越曾几何时见到的流星
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.59,1:19:43.34,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}いつかみた流星を追い越して
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.34,1:19:46.59,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}正要带你一同前往
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.34,1:19:46.59,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君を連れてくよ
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.59,1:19:48.13,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}辉光的所在
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.59,1:19:48.13,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}輝きの先
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.75,1:20:15.37,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}We are the travelers
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.37,1:20:17.05,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}现在正从太阳系动身
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.37,1:20:17.05,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}太陽系を今旅立つ
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.05,1:20:18.79,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们将化身那道光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.05,1:20:18.79,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}僕らはそう光になる
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.79,1:20:20.34,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让思想本身发生转变
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.79,1:20:20.34,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}思考自体変わるぐらい
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.34,1:20:21.97,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}愿到达那耀眼的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.34,1:20:21.97,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}まばゆい世界届けたい
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.97,1:20:23.90,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Across the Universe
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:25.91,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在星海之中开辟航路
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:25.91,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星の海を切り開く
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.91,1:20:27.33,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}相信爱会在瞬息之间
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.91,1:20:27.33,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}アイがほらじきに
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.33,1:20:29.10,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}掀起全新的奇点风暴
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.33,1:20:29.10,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}巻き起こすさシンギュラリティ
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.63,1:20:32.80,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}几亿光年的遥远
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.63,1:20:32.80,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}何億光年だって
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.80,1:20:36.30,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}只要能与你同行  定能到达
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.80,1:20:36.30,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君となら行ける、きっと
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.30,1:20:43.66,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如此莽撞的梦想  依旧想要全部实现
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.30,1:20:43.66,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}無謀な夢を見て、叶えたいよ全部
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.66,1:20:47.07,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}穿越银河（去往更遥远的地方）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.66,1:20:47.07,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}銀河を超えて(もっと遠くへ)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.07,1:20:53.69,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}比宇宙更遥远的所在
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.07,1:20:53.69,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}宇宙を超えた先へ
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.69,1:20:57.34,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must go  与你见证梦想的延续
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.69,1:20:57.34,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must go　君と見た夢の続き
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.39,1:21:04.37,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must show  陪伴着你前行的光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.39,1:21:04.37,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must show　君を連れて行く光
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.45,1:21:11.25,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must see  尚未有人涉足的前方
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.45,1:21:11.25,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must see　誰もまだ知らない先
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.35,1:21:20.17,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如果你的爱能够将我照亮的话
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.35,1:21:20.17,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君のアイが　私を照らしてくれるなら
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.37,1:21:25.23,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}用“无限大”什么的形容还远远不够
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.37,1:21:25.23,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}無限大なんて言葉じゃまだ足りない
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.23,1:21:28.30,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}有你陪伴的话能走得更远
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.23,1:21:28.30,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君とならもっと遠くまで
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.30,1:21:33.57,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}爱将成为突破时间与次元的那道光
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.30,1:21:33.57,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}アイは時間も次元も超える光になる
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.57,1:21:35.48,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好好瞧着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.57,1:21:35.48,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}見ていてね
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.48,1:21:40.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与你一同去确认
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.48,1:21:40.01,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と確かめに行こう
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.01,1:21:42.44,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}直到辉光所在
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.01,1:21:42.44,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}輝きの先まで
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.44,1:21:48.11,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在无限的希望中
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.44,1:21:48.11,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}果てしない希望の中へ
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.64,1:21:56.08,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}向着地平线那端的远方
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.64,1:21:56.08,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}水平線の向こうの方へ
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.08,1:21:59.56,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}试着追逐流星探出的手
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.08,1:21:59.56,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流星を追って伸ばした手
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.56,1:22:03.32,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来吧  不妨就此动身奔赴前去
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.56,1:22:03.32,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}さぁ、立ち上がって走り出したら
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.32,1:22:06.45,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与你一同踏上旅途
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.32,1:22:06.45,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}旅に出よう、君と
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.45,1:22:08.45,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}直到遥远彼方
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.45,1:22:08.45,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}遠く遠くまで
Comment: 0,1:22:21.01,1:22:23.01,Title,,0,0,0,,MC4
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.42,1:22:24.47,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}非常感谢各位
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.25,1:22:26.63,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在这个环节中
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.63,1:22:35.98,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们为大家带来了「ゲンキトリッパー」、「星彩ステッパー」、「99 Nights」以及「VOY@GER」这四首歌曲
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.23,1:22:39.11,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}弥生一口气连唱四首歌确实不容易
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.69,1:22:41.47,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}表现得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.24,1:22:46.17,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在舞台上看到观众们的灿烂笑容
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.42,1:22:49.31,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}所有的疲惫瞬间就烟消云散了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.24,1:22:53.77,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}特别是「99 Nights」以及「VOY@GER」这两首歌
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.99,1:22:57.43,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}是我和伊织反复排练了很长时间的舞蹈
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.70,1:23:00.65,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}真心希望各位能够喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.58,1:23:04.25,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}没错  我们经常练习到深夜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.55,1:23:08.76,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我和弥生一起反复琢磨和练习的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.30,1:23:16.09,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大家觉得弥生和伊织的表演精不精彩？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.48,1:23:23.04,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}真是太成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.01,1:23:30.88,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}虽然舍不得结束  但接下来就是最后一首歌了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.21,1:23:40.35,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}最后一首是我们的新歌  请大家欣赏！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.15,1:23:44.55,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这首歌曲是专门为本次演唱会量身打造的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.89,1:23:47.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}是专属于我们的特别曲目
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.69,1:23:49.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如果大家愿意的话
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.48,1:23:53.17,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请用伊织和弥生的应援色
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.59,1:23:56.41,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一起营造一片美丽的花海吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.03,1:23:58.15,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}歌词中融入了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.46,1:23:59.93,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}粉色与橙色
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.26,1:24:03.43,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这些代表我们的主题色彩
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.93,1:24:06.65,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}就像和大家愉快交谈一般
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.95,1:24:10.33,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们将为大家打造一个温馨美好的空间
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.06,1:24:13.23,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那么要开始咯  弥生
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.41,1:24:14.12,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.62,1:24:15.75,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请欣赏——
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.59,1:24:18.25,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「Flower Knows」
Comment: 0,1:24:25.65,1:24:30.65,Title,,0,0,0,,#16 Flower Knows
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.65,1:24:30.65,词曲,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\an4}#16 Flower Knows{\fs35}\N\N作词：八城雄太\N作曲：栗原悠希\N编曲：栗原悠希\N翻译：花椰菜牧师
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.96,1:24:26.68,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}"听我说听我说"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.96,1:24:26.68,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「ねぇねぇ」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.28,1:24:31.46,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我在那条往常的路上
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.28,1:24:31.46,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}いつもと同じ通で
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.46,1:24:35.76,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}发现了一颗闪亮亮的种子！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.46,1:24:35.76,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}キラキラ光る種みっけ！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.76,1:24:40.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}用手帕轻轻包好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.76,1:24:40.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ハンカチふわりくるみ
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.06,1:24:42.89,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好要送给你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.06,1:24:42.89,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君に届けたくて
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.89,1:24:44.52,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}跳呀  跳呀  跳呀
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.89,1:24:44.52,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}スキップ　スキップ　スキップ
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.36,1:24:47.26,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}"突然好想见你呀"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.36,1:24:47.26,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「急に会いたくなっちゃった」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.26,1:24:49.06,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}"嘻嘻  那我们就来聊聊天吧！"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.26,1:24:49.06,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「ふふっ。おはなししよう！」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.49,1:24:51.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}"明明每天都见面呢"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.49,1:24:51.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「毎日会ってるのに」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.22,1:24:53.52,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}"想说的话  有好多好多哦"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.22,1:24:53.52,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「話したいこと、たくさんあるよ」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.62,1:24:55.59,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}虽然都是些不起眼的小事
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.62,1:24:55.59,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}なんでもないけど
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.59,1:25:02.56,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\t(1700,1900,\3c&H726607&)}但满满都是  {\3c&H3999F3&}无可替代的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.59,1:25:02.56,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}かけがえないこと　{\t(1700,1900,\3c&H726607&)}あふれてるの
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.36,1:25:08.39,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们就像一片花田
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.36,1:25:08.39,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}お花畑みたい　ふたり
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.86,1:25:11.96,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}只要一聊起天
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.86,1:25:11.96,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}おしゃべりしたら
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.96,1:25:15.66,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}就轻轻飞舞  染上颜色
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.96,1:25:15.66,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ひらり舞って　色がついて
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.60,1:25:17.87,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}等一下{\t(1200,1400,\3c&H3999F3&)}(什么呀？)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.60,1:25:17.87,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}待って{\t(1200,1400,\3c&H3999F3&)}(なぁに？)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.87,1:25:20.62,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}脸颊变得粉扑扑
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.87,1:25:20.62,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ほっぺがピンク
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.86,1:25:25.52,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}反正只有花儿在听嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.86,1:25:25.52,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}お花しか聞いてないからね
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.29,1:25:31.42,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}就算是秘密也没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.29,1:25:31.42,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ナイショの話だっていいよ
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.76,1:25:34.73,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}说得不好也没关系{\t(2100,2300,\3c&HE199FD&)}(可以吗？)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.76,1:25:34.73,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}上手じゃなくっていいよく{\t(2100,2300,\3c&HE199FD&)}(いいの？)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.02,1:25:43.82,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为你的话语  {\t(3000,3200,\3c&H726607&)}会让花朵绽放呀
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.02,1:25:43.82,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君の言葉で　{\t(3000,3200,\3c&H726607&)}花は咲いているの
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.96,1:26:04.99,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那些说不清道不明的心情
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.96,1:26:04.99,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ぽつぽつ　こぼれだした
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.32,1:26:09.39,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一滴一滴  满溢而出
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.32,1:26:09.39,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}かたちにならない気持ち
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.66,1:26:13.79,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}像温柔的雨点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.66,1:26:13.79,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}優しい雨のように
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.02,1:26:16.56,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}轻轻敲着内心深处
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.02,1:26:16.56,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}胸の奥の方を
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.72,1:26:18.59,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}咚咚  咚咚  咚咚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.72,1:26:18.59,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ノック　ノック　ノック
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.59,1:26:22.62,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在下雨天做个约定吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.59,1:26:22.62,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}雨の日は　約束しよう
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.06,1:26:27.02,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}去找彩虹吧  去散步吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.06,1:26:27.02,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}虹探し　お散歩しよう
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.42,1:26:31.72,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}感觉能做出最喜欢颜色的伞呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.42,1:26:31.72,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大好きな色の傘できそうから
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.72,1:26:36.72,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}所以就一起笑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.72,1:26:36.72,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}笑っちゃおうよ
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.26,1:26:42.32,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们就像一片花田
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.26,1:26:42.32,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}お花畑みたい　ふたり
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.69,1:26:47.96,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}从唯一那颗亮闪闪的种子开始
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.69,1:26:47.96,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}たったひとつの光る種から
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.15,1:26:49.58,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一点一点铺开去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.15,1:26:49.58,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}広がっていって
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.58,1:26:54.49,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}把全部全部染成橘色
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.58,1:26:54.49,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ぜんぶ　染まるオレンジ
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.69,1:26:59.36,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}只有花儿在听  {\t(3700,3900,\3c&HE199FD&}我说呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.69,1:26:59.36,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}お花しか聞いてない　{\t(3700,3900,\3c&HE199FD&}あのね
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.23,1:27:05.42,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我有一个对妈妈也保密的梦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.23,1:27:05.42,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ママにも秘密の夢があるの
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.59,1:27:11.99,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一个珍贵的梦  不要说笑话我哦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.59,1:27:11.99,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大切な夢　笑わないでね
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.39,1:27:14.66,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不知不觉间就长高了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.39,1:27:14.66,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}気づいたら背が押びて
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.66,1:27:17.92,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那个大人模样的影子
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.66,1:27:17.92,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大人びたカグボウシは
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.16,1:27:20.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我不会松开  不会松开
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.16,1:27:20.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}はなさない　はなさない
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.06,1:27:26.32,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}小指要紧紧勾在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.06,1:27:26.32,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}小指をきゅっと結ぶよ
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.32,1:27:30.17,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让花儿开放吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.32,1:27:30.17,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}咲かそうよ　花を
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.17,1:27:35.22,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}和你一起  一直一直
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.17,1:27:35.22,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君とずっと
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.69,1:27:49.52,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}"再见啦"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.69,1:27:49.52,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「まだね」
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.39,1:28:04.47,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}今天{\3c&HE199FD&}由高槻弥生和水濑伊织
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.47,1:28:11.16,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\3c&HE199FD&}双人演唱会「友谊永存！{\3c&H3999F3&}笑容绽放」公演
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.92,1:28:14.29,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}非常感谢各位的到来！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.21,1:28:16.47,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}下次再见啦！
Comment: 0,1:30:13.37,1:30:13.41,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}STORY
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.96,1:30:22.66,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在花的国度向花朵微笑  它们就会闪闪发光  那道光芒化作了微笑的种子
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.32,1:30:27.40,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}于是  公主与小镇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.72,1:30:30.32,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}将种子带回了阳光普照的国度
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.78,1:30:32.16,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}遍植于全国各处
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.10,1:30:37.68,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}每当多一个人展露笑颜
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.28,1:30:40.20,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}种子便会绽放花朵
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.82,1:30:42.36,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}阳光普照的国度
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.74,1:30:44.68,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}便开满了鲜花
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.72,1:30:48.78,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}公主凭倚高窗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.86,1:30:52.70,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}小镇姑娘立于繁华街市
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.66,1:30:56.92,pop - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}两人赏花相视而笑
